<h2 dir="auto">Churn over time</h2>
<p dir="auto">A new card in the dashboard: the 30-day rolling churn of paying customers over the last 90 days (each day, the share of customers paying 30 days earlier who no longer pay), with the customers lost each day underneath. Hover any day for the figures.</p>
